// Motor v=min(9,.9*v+1) at 60Hz, each tick's change ramped over four
// substeps (a tick covers (v + 5/8 change) * dt). At tick 6 the player
// reaches z=-.351506, leaving the northern enemy inside the first Cleave sample.
// Cleave hits that enemy with +Z impulse, despite -Z movement and new +X aim.
